  "prefLabel": "Fis 503.07 Intra-scholastic Fishing Tournaments",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 503.07 Intra-scholastic Fishing Tournaments.\n\n(a) Schools holding intra-scholastic fishing tournaments shall provide the New Hampshire fish and game department, fisheries division, with the following information at least 3 days prior to the beginning of their intra-scholastic tournament:\n\n(1) School name;\n\n(2) Contact name;\n\n(3) Contact phone number and email address;\n\n(4) Tournament date;\n\n(5) Water body;\n\n(6) Maximum number of boats;\n\n(7) Species targeted; and\n\n(8) If tournament operates under a format of catch, measure, and immediate release.\n\n(b) Intra-scholastic fishing tournaments shall be conducted as specified in Fis 503.02(d), Fis 503.05, and Fis 503.06(a), (d) and (e).\n\n(c) Schools shall report as specified in Fis 503.04.\n\nSource. #10541, eff 4-1-14; ss by #13798, eff 11-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fis500.html"
